flowchart LR
  subgraph Browser[React browser]
    Q[User question] --> C[Conversation context and frozen scope]
    C --> Submit[Submit or clarify]
    Poll[Task polling] --> View[Public answer and evidence]
  end
  Submit --> API[Task API]
  API --> Tasks[(PostgreSQL task store)]
  Tasks --> Worker[TaskWorker]
  Worker --> Plan[ReviewQueryPlan]
  Plan --> Direct[Confirmed query]
  Plan --> HA[HelloAgents SimpleAgent]
  HA <--> LLM[Configured provider]
  Direct --> Tools[ReviewToolContext and registry]
  HA --> Tools
  Tools --> SQL[(Readonly repeatable read SQL)]
  SQL --> Validate[Statistical and semantic validation]
  Validate --> Compress[AnalysisResultCompressor]
  Compress --> Compact[CompactAnalysisContext]
  Compact --> Generate[NaturalLanguageAnswerGenerator]
  Generate <--> LLM
  Generate --> Assemble[AnswerValidator and AnswerAssembler]
  Assemble --> PA[PublicAnswer]
  PA --> Tasks
  Tasks --> Public[Owner API or public whitelist API]
  Public --> Poll
  Labels[Label workers] <--> Redis[(Existing Redis label queue)]
  Labels --> Annotations[(Annotations and human corrections)]
  Annotations --> SQL
